@page "/privacy"

@* A starting point only. Your organisation's data protection officer should review and
   complete this before the service goes live. *@

<PageTitle>Privacy notice – @AppInfo.ServiceName</PageTitle>

<div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
        <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Privacy notice</h1>

        <GovUkWarningText>This is a draft privacy notice. It must be reviewed by your data protection officer before the service goes live.</GovUkWarningText>

        <p class="govuk-body">This notice explains what information @AppInfo.ServiceName collects when you use it, and how that information is used.</p>

        <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Who is responsible for your data</h2>
        <p class="govuk-body">@AppInfo.OrganisationName is the data controller for the information processed by this service.</p>

        <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">What information we collect</h2>
        <p class="govuk-body">The service does not ask you for any personal information.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">Like most websites, the servers that run the service may record technical information about requests, such as the page requested and the time of the request. This is used to keep the service running and secure, and to investigate problems.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">The service uses one essential cookie. Read more about <a class="govuk-link" href="/cookies">how we use cookies</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">How long we keep your information</h2>
        <p class="govuk-body">Technical logs are kept only for as long as they are needed to run and secure the service.</p>

        <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="govuk-body">You have the right to ask for a copy of any personal information we hold about you, and to ask us to correct or delete it.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">To ask about your information, email @AppInfo.ContactEmail.</p>

        <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">How to complain</h2>
        <p class="govuk-body">If you're not happy with how we have used your information, you can <a class="govuk-link" href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (opens in new tab)</a>.</p>
    </div>
</div>
